*****************************************************************               
*                                                               *               
* ARBETSAREA                                                    *               
*                                                               *               
*****************************************************************               
*                                                                               
W-IDPTYP                W   3  A                                                
W-IDLOPNR               W   3  N     MASK 'ZZ9'                                 
W-IDDISTR-FOM           W   5  N     MASK 'ZZZZZ'                               
W-IDDISTR-TOM           W   5  N     MASK 'ZZZZZ'                               
W-IDKUNDNR-FOM          W   7  N     MASK 'ZZZZZZZ'                             
W-IDKUNDNR-TOM          W   7  N     MASK 'ZZZZZZZ'                             
W-IDSKYLT               W   3  A                                                
W-KVVECKOR              W   3  N     MASK 'ZZZ'                                 
W-IDFKNGRP-FOM          W   5  N     MASK 'ZZZZZ'                               
W-IDFKNGRP-TOM          W   5  N     MASK 'ZZZZZ'                               
W-IDDISTR-NYTT          W   5  N     MASK 'ZZZZZ'                               
*                                                                               
W-IN-DATUM              W   8  A                                                
W-IN-AA   W-IN-DATUM        2  N                                                
W-IN-MM   W-IN-DATUM   +3   2  N                                                
W-IN-DD   W-IN-DATUM   +6   2  N                                                
*                                                                               
W-UT-DATUM              W   6  N     MASK '99-99-99'                            
W-UT-AA   W-UT-DATUM        2  N                                                
W-UT-MM   W-UT-DATUM   +2   2  N                                                
W-UT-DD   W-UT-DATUM   +4   2  N                                                
